{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10121060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10121060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1012106001:1":{"text":"What's the situation?","source_cn":"情况怎么样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x065B605E6D549B01","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's the situation?","female":"What's the situation?","variant_male_record_index":"110968","variant_female_record_index":"110969","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1012106001":{"text":"What's the situation?","source_cn":"情况怎么样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x065B605E6D549B01","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's the situation?","female":"What's the situation?","variant_male_record_index":"110968","variant_female_record_index":"110969","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012106002:0":{"text":"It seems that the corruption has spread even here. At this rate, the Vaduso Mountains are done for.","source_cn":"看来腐化已经蔓延到这里了，照这个速度……瓦度索山脉撑不...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6B98371FEFDB0DA4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It seems that the corruption has spread even here. At this rate, the Vaduso Mountains are done for.","female":"It seems that the corruption has spread even here. At this rate, the Vaduso Mountains are done for.","variant_male_record_index":"110970","variant_female_record_index":"110971","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012106003:1":{"text":"Hmm... I'm getting a weird feeling. I'm sensing <style=\"highlight\">other magical forces</style> at work. They're battling the chaos magic.","source_cn":"唔……也许是我的错觉，但我感受到了<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF11DC59A0DD6E0EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012106004:1":{"text":"It could be Master Arden. He may be nearby.","source_cn":"也许是雅顿老爷子？他说不定就在附近。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF08E303E5942875F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012106005:1":{"text":"Well, the magic I'm sensing is quite... gentle. Master Arden's magic should feel more steadfast and unyielding.","source_cn":"唔，这股魔力相当温柔呢……贤者大人的魔力应该更加刚硬才对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E25F0E29FA041F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012106006:1":{"text":"Gentle...? Could it be...?","source_cn":"温柔的魔力？难道是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CEAB94F8840B23A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012106007:1":{"text":"You all don't know Master Arden like I do. He's always been gentle and kind—to me, at least. He never yelled at me or anything. Remember, Bryon?","source_cn":"哎呀，你们都不了解雅顿老爷子。他一直很温柔啊，从不凶我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3B2EAC1A9039521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012106008:1":{"text":"I remember everything. Apparently, you do not.","source_cn":"您确定要我帮你回忆吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26DE8A9C85C87165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012106009:1":{"text":"Master Arden's beard, eyebrows, and horns all bore the brunt of your antics. In the end, he opted to conjure vines to dangle you upside down from an oak tree.","source_cn":"他的胡子、眉毛、角，都受过洛桑大人的摧残。最后，您被他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E71641D79E12856","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012106010:1":{"text":"Alright! Can we not speak of things that happened two centuries ago? I admit I was a mischievous child, haven't I changed?","source_cn":"停！两百年前的事能不能别拿出来说？我承认我小时候调皮…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90384E066B3A3DC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012106011:1":{"text":"Have you now...?","source_cn":"是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F82749FE11E4C47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012106012:1":{"text":"Don't speak so high and mighty with me! I remember when you broke Master Arden's old staff!","source_cn":"而且——你也没好到哪去！我还记得你折断过老爷子的法杖！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7E40E6EAD390418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1012106013:1":{"text":"I do not recall that.","source_cn":"我不记得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD77FB10D7D8B32C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012106014:1":{"text":"Well, I recall everything! Besides, we rabbits are more rambunctious when we're young. Lyca was the same. If you don't believe me, go ask Granny Dahnie.","source_cn":"我记得很清楚！再说了，我们兔子小时候都比较活泼，莱卡不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FB7E2C4C599553B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012106015:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1012106015":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1012106016:1":{"text":"I can see that!\nI'm so sorry, Lyca. I didn't mean to bring up your embarrassing childhood stories. Please forgive me!","source_cn":"我看出来了！\\n姐……我错了，我不该提你小时候的糗事，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x183E71778856F0C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1012106017:0":{"text":"Until we meet up with Master Arden, don't let me hear another word out of you... or there will be consequences, Lorsan.","source_cn":"至少……见到雅顿贤者以前，别让我再听到这些。洛桑，你知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61F23F5FB119CB93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1012106018:0":{"text":"Yes, of course! Not another word out of me!","source_cn":"是，遵命！我保证不说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A7AB9A2BB7633EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1012106019:0":{"text":"Quickly now... Let's hurry! We're almost at Taran Village!","source_cn":"快……咱们还是继续赶路吧！就快到塔兰村了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B708669DF114F66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"I think you made her mad.","source_cn":"洛桑，你姐姐在生气","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA77B95B57A1EFFEE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I think you made her mad.","female":"I think you made her mad.","variant_male_record_index":"61444","variant_female_record_index":"61445","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"Not good...","source_cn":"不容乐观……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA608FA0A0D8891BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Not good...","female":"Not good...","variant_male_record_index":"61442","variant_female_record_index":"61443","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"Lorsan","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"Lyca","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"Bryon","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":4}}